  "details": "Although the new UI for user profiles has a few new options now (E.g. more room for a description and telling what your level of trust is), these things could be added to the old UI easily by just making small tweaks like adding a scroll bar or shrinking the text size. Also, it's confusing for all the buttons to suddenly be on the complete opposite sides of the screen after getting so used to their old positions! Also, the location of the unfriend button is very close to where the join world button used to be...\nAll in all, the old UI could easily be added back in with some small changes made to add more things. That's all from me!",
